[N 29-30 Ashenvale: the East]
[D Forever Alliance 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Ashenvale's east half: Raene's long chain from Shael'dryn's moonwell to Krolg, Forest Song and the Xavian satyrs, the Dor'danil druid camp in the south-east and an optional Tower of Althalaxx tail, ending with the flight to Auberdine and the boat to Menethil.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffAshenvale 29-30|r  -  you start in Astranaar (36,50) at level ~29 with the Darnassus and Stonetalon errands behind you; hearth = Sentinel Hill and it stays there. This is the guide's big overland chapter: ~36,000 quest XP in the main loop (plus ~7,300 optional and ~5,600 on the Althalaxx tail), all kill, collect and click work, nothing elite in the DB. Four legs: the moonwell and the Ancients north-east of town, Forest Song and the Xavian satyrs in the far east, the Dor'danil druid camp in the south-east (twice), then the south around Lake Mystral. Plan ~90 minutes; you reach 30 on the way
[OC]|cffffcc00Where things are:|r the moonwell (53.5,46) and Hidden Shrine (56.4,49) are the middle; Forest Song (85,45) and Xavian (78,45) the far east; the south-east corner (68-79, 64-85) holds the Rusty Chests and the druid camp; Silverwind Refuge (49.5,67) and Krolg (50.8,75) the south; Illiyana and Maestra's Post the west coast, where the chapter ends
[OC]|cffffcc00Training:|r nothing in Ashenvale trains you; level-30 spells wait for Ironforge (chapter 24). Hunters: Astranaar has no ammo vendor, so count your stack before the long loop

[OC]|cffffffffShael'dryn and the Ancients|r  -  Raene's chain, the long middle (~13,900 XP across 1026-1046): Dartol's Rod is rebuilt piece by piece, charged at a hidden shrine, then used on an uncorrupted furbolg in the south
Walk east along the road to the moonwell [G53.5,46.2 Ashenvale]
At [TAR3916 Shael'dryn], [QT1024] [QA1026 Raene's Cleansing] (830 + 2,200 XP. 1026 = a Wooden Key from an Ancient, then the Iron Shaft from a locked chest - |cff66ff66normal|r) [G53.5,46.2 Ashenvale]
[O]Only if you took The Howling Vale (1022, 2,450 XP) in chapter 20: the Tome of Mel'Thandris lies in a cave about 8 units north of the moonwell (mouth near 53,37.6, tome at 50.5,39.1) - click it and walk out. Another guide warns the cave is easy to overpull and a rare roams it: pull one mob at a time. It hands in at Melyria in the far west at the end [QC1022] [G50.5,39.1 Ashenvale]
Kill [TAR3919 Withered Ancient] and [TAR3834 Crazed Ancient] (26-28) around the chest until a Wooden Key drops - 17% per kill for both per metaforge.app's Forever data (not in our DB, unverified), so |cff66ff66normal|r at ~6 kills [G56.0,33.2 Ashenvale]
Open the Worn Chest with the Wooden Key and take the Iron Shaft [QC1026] [G54.4,35.4 Ashenvale]
At [TAR3916 Shael'dryn], [QT1026] [QA1027 Raene's Cleansing] (2,200 XP. 1027 = the last rod piece, which the druids of Dor'danil hid in a Rusty Chest in the south-east corner - the loop below passes it) [G53.5,46.2 Ashenvale]
[OC]|cffffcc00Optional detour, +25 units:|r Slowing the Orc Advance (86757, 2,550 XP) must be accepted BEFORE you meet the Horde grunts and scouts near Forest Song, and Shandrina stands at Silverwind Refuge. |cFFFF0000Grind risk:|r the 6 Jagged Orcish Swords (grunts) and 4 Curved Orcish Daggers (scouts) are plain weapon drops with no rate in the DB. Give it ~30 Horde kills while you are in the east anyway, then drop it if you are short
[O]At [TAR3955 Shandrina], [QA86757 Slowing the Orc Advance] [G49.5,67.1 Ashenvale]
[OC]Leftovers at the refuge, none closed by this chapter: Velene's Mage Summoner (1017, Sarilus in the Barrens, GROUP 3+) and Alonso's three Dragonslayer quests (43,70, six units west). If you took 1017 and are not going to the Barrens, abandon it

[OC]|cffffffffForest Song and Xavian|r  -  the far east: Kayneth and Maseara at the camp, Anilia and the satyrs (28-32) seven units west of it
[O]Run north-east to the Circle of Imprisonment in Night Run and click it to free the Highborne souls - The Tower of Althalaxx (1140, taken in chapter 12; the second circle is at Satyrnaar below) [QC1140,1] [G66.6,57.0 Ashenvale]
Run east to Forest Song [G85.2,44.7 Ashenvale]
At [TAR3848 Kayneth Stillwind], [QT4581] [QA1011 Forsaken Diseases] (590 XP now. 1011 = one Bottle of Disease from the south-east camp, 2,350 XP - |cff66ff66normal|r) [G85.2,44.7 Ashenvale]
At [TAR221269 Maseara Autumnmoon], [QA98418 Shared Fury] [QA98417 Vengeful Trail] (2,450 XP each. 98418 = 5 each of four satyr types - |cff66ff66normal|r. 98417 wants a Vine-Wrapped Scroll "west of Forest Song, amongst the Satyrnaar demons": its object has no spawn in the DB, so it is a look-around) [G86.3,45.8 Ashenvale]
Walk west to the satyr camp at Xavian [G78.3,44.8 Ashenvale]
At [TAR3920 Anilia], [QT1021] [QA1031 The Branch of Cenarius] (2,550 XP each) [G78.3,44.8 Ashenvale]
Kill 5 each of [TAR3752 Xavian Rogue], [TAR3754 Xavian Betrayer], [TAR3755 Xavian Felsworn] and [TAR3757 Xavian Hellcaller] (28-30; pull from the camp's edge so one pack comes at a time) [QC98418] [G78.3,45.0 Ashenvale]
Kill [TAR4619 Geltharis] (32, one named non-elite satyr - |cff66ff66normal|r but two levels above you; kill the pack beside him first) and take the Branch of Cenarius [QC1031] [G78.0,42.4 Ashenvale]
[OC]While you kill, look on the ground around Xavian and Satyrnaar for a vine-wrapped scroll or bundle to click for 98417. The DB gives no position, so if one lap of the camps shows nothing, abandon 98417 rather than hunt
[O]Click the second Circle of Imprisonment at Satyrnaar [QC1140,2] [G81.6,48.6 Ashenvale]
[OC]|cffffcc00Skipped on purpose:|r Satyr Slaying! (1032, 2,550 XP) is accepted from Illiyana in the far west after you hand in 1031, and its 16 Satyr Horns are a quest-only drop of these same satyrs - a second 120-unit trip. Leave it

[OC]|cffffffffSouth-east corner, first pass|r  -  the Horde edge, the Rusty Chests, the bottle, the Oracle and the pendant, then back up to Forest Song
[O]Run south-east to the Horde Grunts (29-30, swords) and Scouts (26-28, daggers) at the east edge, in Horde territory: take the ones outside the camp, leave anything elite-tagged. Fight while you wait for respawns, not instead of the loop [QC86757] [G88.6,57.7 Ashenvale]
Run south to the northern Rusty Chests and open them until one holds the Iron Pommel (about 40 possible chest spots across 68-79 x 64-85; no key in the DB) [QC1027] [G78.3,64.6 Ashenvale]
Loot a Bottle of Disease from the pile at the druid camp (five spawns on one spot). The three druids stand 2-4 units away and give no credit yet: pull them carefully and kill any that engage [QC1011] [G75.3,72.0 Ashenvale]
Kill [TAR3931 Shadethicket Oracle] (30, one named non-elite; a Horde patrol of 26-30 stands 3-6 units east of him) and take the Fallen Moonstone [QC1035] [G66.7,82.2 Ashenvale]
Click the Gleaming Crescent Pendant lying on the ground [QA98027 Gleaming Crescent Necklace] (2,350 XP; the necklace goes to Maliynn in Astranaar) [G63.0,71.5 Ashenvale]
Run back north-east to Forest Song [G85.2,44.7 Ashenvale]
At [TAR3848 Kayneth Stillwind], [QT1011] [QA1012 Insane Druids] (2,350 XP now. 1012 = the three druids at the camp you just left, 3,200 XP: two more 30-unit legs, worth it) [G85.2,44.7 Ashenvale]
At [TAR221269 Maseara Autumnmoon], [QT98418] [QT98417] (2,450 XP each; 98417 only if you found the scroll) [G86.3,45.8 Ashenvale]
[OC]|cffffffffThe druids|r  -  three level-32 mobs against your 29-30: pull one at a time and finish it before the next; stay out of the cave mouths if the camp has one
Run back south to the Dor'danil camp and kill [TAR3940 Taneel Darkwood], [TAR3941 Uthil Mooncall] and [TAR3942 Mavoris Cloudsbreak] [QC1012] [G76.8,73.5 Ashenvale]
Run north once more to Forest Song [G85.2,44.7 Ashenvale]
At [TAR3848 Kayneth Stillwind], [QT1012] (3,200 XP) [G85.2,44.7 Ashenvale]
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Gear (1012):|r take |cff66ff66Mavoris's Warstaff|r (2H staff 21.6 dps +11 Str +3 Sta, new in Forever) unless you carry Graverobber's Shovel (23.0 dps +12 AP) or a 22+ dps axe or mace: it beats the Orc Crusher and Ursine Hammer tier. Emil's Brand is a sword (not a shaman weapon) and Uthil's Cudgel a 16.6 dps one-hander: pass
[OC][A Hunter] |cffffcc00Gear (1012):|r all three are melee sticks with no Agility. |cff66ff66Mavoris's Warstaff|r only if you trained Staves and have nothing better than Kam's Walking Stick; Emil's Brand (2H sword 21.6 dps +11 Str) only if you use swords; otherwise vendor
[OC]Back toward the moonwell: finish any Horde kills on the way if you took 86757, then run west

[OC]|cffffffffBack to the moonwell|r  -  the rod
At [TAR3916 Shael'dryn], [QT1027] [QA1028 Raene's Cleansing] (2,300 XP; she hands you the Reconstructed Rod) [G53.5,46.2 Ashenvale]
Walk to the Hidden Shrine a few steps south-east and use it to charge the rod [QT1028] [QA1055 Raene's Cleansing] (1,700 XP; you receive Dartol's Rod of Transformation, keep it) [G56.4,49.2 Ashenvale]
At [TAR3916 Shael'dryn], [QT1055] [QA1029 Raene's Cleansing] (230 XP) [G53.5,46.2 Ashenvale]

[OC]|cffffffffAstranaar|r  -  hand in the items from the south-east, then south to Krolg
At [TAR3691 Raene Wolfrunner], [QT1029] [QA1030 Raene's Cleansing] (230 XP now. 1030 = turn into a furbolg and talk to Krolg, 1,700 XP) [G36.6,49.6 Ashenvale]
At [TAR3894 Pelturas Whitemoon], [QT1035] (3,050 XP) [G37.4,51.8 Ashenvale]
