[OC][A Hunter] |cffffcc00Gear (1035):|r Snapbrook Armor (+4 Str +9 Spi) only if your chest is under 94 armor with no Agility or AP; Luminescent Amice (cloth) and Beastial Manacles (mail) are no use - vendor
At [TAR3961 Maliynn], [QT98027] (2,350 XP) [G36.6,50.0 Ashenvale]
[OC]|cffffcc00Gear (98027):|r both of you wear the |cff66ff66Replica Crescent Necklace|r (neck +3 Agi +3 Spi) unless your neck has more Agility
[OC]|cffffffffThe south: Krolg and Ran Bloodtooth|r  -  Lake Mystral's furbolg camp, 25 units south-east of Astranaar
Run south-east to Krolg on the north shore of Lake Mystral [G50.8,75.1 Ashenvale]
At [TAR3897 Krolg], use [UI5462 Dartol's Rod of Transformation] to turn into a furbolg, then talk to him [QT1030] [QA1045 Raene's Cleansing] (1,700 XP now. 1045 = Ran Bloodtooth and 4 Bloodtooth Guards, 2,450 XP) [G50.8,75.1 Ashenvale]
Kill [TAR3696 Ran Bloodtooth] (30, one named non-elite furbolg) and 4 [TAR3932 Bloodtooth Guard] (27-28) at the furbolg camp [QC1045] [G55.0,78.0 Ashenvale]
At [TAR3897 Krolg], [QT1045] [QA1046 Raene's Cleansing] (2,450 XP now. 1046 = Ran's skull and the rod to Raene, 3,050 XP) [G50.8,75.1 Ashenvale]
[OC]Ran Bloodtooth's Skull is a quest-only item that the DB lists under 1046 alone, so expect it to drop only now that you hold 1046: kill Ran a second time once he respawns (wait at the camp, or kill more guards for XP). If a skull already dropped on the first kill, skip the next line
Kill [TAR3696 Ran Bloodtooth] again and loot his skull [QC1046] [G54.8,79.6 Ashenvale]
[O]At [TAR3955 Shandrina] at Silverwind Refuge, [QT86757] (2,550 XP; skip if you did not take it or are short of swords and daggers) [G49.5,67.1 Ashenvale]
At [TAR3691 Raene Wolfrunner], [QT1046] (3,050 XP) [G36.6,49.6 Ashenvale]
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Gear (1046):|r take |cff66ff66Glacial Stone|r (2H mace 21.0 dps, chance on hit 75 frost damage) unless you hold Graverobber's Shovel or Mavoris's Warstaff; Gutterblade is a one-hander. The fixed Ring of Pure Silver (+1 Sta +6 Spi) is for an empty ring slot only
[OC][A Hunter] |cffffcc00Gear (1046):|r hunters cannot use maces, so Glacial Stone is vendor fodder; take Gutterblade (1H axe 16.1 dps +3 Str +3 Sta) only if your melee weapon is worse. The Ring of Pure Silver is Spirit: pass

[OC]|cffffffffWest coast|r  -  Illiyana's camp (22,53) is 15 units west of Astranaar, Maestra's Post another 15 north
Run west to Illiyana's camp on the coast [G21.7,53.3 Ashenvale]
At [TAR3901 Illiyana], [QT1031] (2,550 XP. Do not take Satyr Slaying! (1032) - see the note at Xavian) [G21.7,53.3 Ashenvale]
